The '''Sonic Texture Pack'''<ref>{{Mcnet|new-sonic-texture-pack|A Sonic-tastic Texture Pack|May 23, 2023|Sophie Austin}}</ref> is a [[texture pack (downloadable content)|texture pack]] that retextures and sometimes remodels various blocks, items and mobs in the game to be themed around the ''[[Sonic the Hedgehog]]'' series.

